            "lines": [
                {
                    "n": "0",
                    "text": "With yellow eyes, my green face, my pink and white afro",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "1",
                    "text": "I'm no toy kid, your style is made by Hasbro",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "2",
                    "text": "Gnip Gnop, you think you got that real hip-hop",
                    "rhyme": "Op",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "3",
                    "text": "I soar the chart so quickly, watched your album flop",
                    "rhyme": "Op",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "4",
                    "text": "I'm Doctor Octo', curlin' weights, tourin' rhinos",
                    "rhyme": "o",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "5",
                    "text": "Liftin' horses, throwin' cows at your fake forces",
                    "rhyme": "ORs",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "6",
                    "text": "You know my gold style, rabbit fur coat style",
                    "rhyme": "il",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "7",
                    "text": "You be freezin' with the flu watch you keep sneezin'",
                    "rhyme": ")",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "8",
                    "text": "Like Breezly Brewin', your style I'mma have to ruin",
                    "rhyme": ")",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "9",
                    "text": "Chop up your tactics, you gimmick groups need to practice",
                    "rhyme": "is",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "10",
                    "text": "You beat it, like Michael Jackson in my atmosphere",
                    "rhyme": "eR",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "11",
                    "text": "Gerbils for rectums, I break you off like Richard Gere",
                    "rhyme": "eR",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "12",
                    "text": "I'm so fantastic, your metal fist is still plastic",
                    "rhyme": "ik",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "13",
                    "text": "Compelled with no threats, your rhymes bounce off my shield",
                    "rhyme": "ild",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "14",
                    "text": "New York City, California, roll my Ampex reel",
                    "rhyme": "El",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "15",
                    "text": "No corny loops and assemble with Timberland boots",
                    "rhyme": "uts",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "16",
                    "text": "I'm strictly monster with turtlenecks like Frankenstein",
                    "rhyme": ")",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "17",
                    "text": "Drop that mic kid, you lost, so that ass is mine",
                    "rhyme": "in",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                }
            ]
        },
