                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "14",
                    "text": "MCs know, retire quick rap like Paul Monroe",
                    "rhyme": "is",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "15",
                    "text": "Joe C. Meriweather with blocks on your skin is clever",
                    "rhyme": "e",
                    "persona": "Dr. Octagon"
                },
                {
                    "n": "16",
                    "text": "Upright direction, I battle any yeast infection",
                    "rhyme": "$",
